8db?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=687ab91c91fc28f0cc32f1e5265de4a8", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Hi there, this is Ethan E. Moreno again! I absolutely loved with what you did with my art commission of Katsu in Lucina's outfit. You definitely knocked it out of the park and made my morning! I have another art commission for you. Do you think you can draw Lent Marslink from Atelier Ryza? Specifically, how he looked in the first game. I would like for you to draw him showing off what he's capable of and I know that you can do it! I hope you can accept my art request and have a great day then!", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "similar_creators": [{"id": 199797, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "あすたら", "screen_name": "Astala_AUC", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1958832009108946944/wfO3CoI5.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/767006741108133889/1735607783/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "nc": 49}, {"id": 683627, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "はちお", "screen_name": "hachio81", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1286613404979851267/BJP-5a3i.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1286613106970341377/1739619420/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "nc": 16}, {"id": 1010058, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "える・ぐれこ", "screen_name": "Eru_Gureco08006", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg